{"id":390,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Full of vigor and always in high spirits. It was once known by the name ”Lantern-Tail” and feared as some kind of apparition."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"The gas made in its belly burns from its rear end. The fire burns weakly when it feels sick."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Pearl"],"text":"Its fiery rear end is fueled by gas made in its belly. Even rain can’t extinguish the fire."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It is very agile. Before going to sleep, it extinguishes the flame on its tail to prevent fires."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"It agilely scales sheer cliffs to live atop craggy mountains. Its fire is put out when it sleeps."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Blaze","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Fire-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Iron Fist","hidden":true,"description":"Powers up punching moves."}],"eggGroups":["Field","Human-Like"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Brown","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":390,"name":"Chimchar","condition":null,"children":[{"id":391,"name":"Monferno","condition":"Lv. 14","children":[{"id":392,"name":"Infernape","condition":"Lv. 36","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,10],[1,43],[7,52],[9,269],[15,154],[17,172],[23,417],[25,259],[31,263],[33,83],[39,512],[41,303],[47,53]],"machine":[512,97,280,339,807,91,38,227,283,203,263,313,126,519,7,83,488,53,394,374,264,447,441,257,270,282,67,490,118,189,417,315,398,182,244,156,157,317,421,214,446,164,241,129,14,36,269,915,851,168,9,369,253,410,261,428],"egg":[68,24,227,252,7,116,257,270,415,9],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv6-31","name":"Chimchar","set":"Twilight Masquerade","date":"2024-05-24","rarity":"Common","number":"31","artist":"Jerky","img":"sv6/31"},{"id":"swsh9-24","name":"Chimchar","set":"Brilliant Stars","date":"2022-02-25",